5,MORORI - Apple Music,https://music.apple.com/us/artist/morori/1806011870,"Listen to music by MORORI on Apple Music. Find top songs and albums by MORORI including Goyoku Midnight ~We Are All One~ (Summer Festival 2025 Gui-Gui Remix (Radio Edit)), Missing You and more.",Morori,Trans-New Guinea
6,Morori language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/morori_language,"Morori, also known as Marori (ISO 639-3: mok), is a highly endangered language isolate of southern New Guinea, spoken exclusively in the Wasur area of Merauke Subdistrict, South Papua, Indonesia.",Morori,Trans-New Guinea
7,OLAC resources in and about the Morori language,http://olac.ldc.upenn.edu/language/mok,"Other known names and dialect names: Marori, Moaraeri, Moraori, Morari. Use faceted search to explore resources for Morori language. Other resources in the language. ONLINEThe linguistic position of South-western New Guinea. Boelaars, J. H. M. C. (Ja...",Morori,Trans-New Guinea
8,"Morori - Wiktionary, the free dictionary",https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Morori,"Morori. An endangered language of Irian Jaya, Indonesia. It is a sole member of the Moraori branch within the large Trans-New Guinea family.",Morori,Trans-New Guinea
